  "The Settings panel lets you select directories for where to store bookmarks,\\nthe viewing history, and the Google profile data, to automatically log you\\nin at every access. If the bookmarks directory isn't specified, bookmarks won't be\\nstored. If the history directory isn't specified, history won't be saved.\\nIf the Google profile directory isn't specified, YAYC will work in Inkognito mode.": "Panel z nastavitvami vam omogoča izbiro direktorij za shranjevanje zaznamkov,\\nzgodovino ogledov in podatkov Google profila, da se ob vsakem dostopu\\nsamodejno prijavite. Če direktorija za zaznamke ni navedena, zaznamki ne bodo\\nshranjeni. Če direktorija za zgodovino ni navedena, zgodovina ne bo shranjena.\\nČe direktorija Google profila ni navedena, bo YAYC deloval v načinu Inkognito.",
