  "YAYC is your modern YouTube client, to help with the organization of scheduled and viewed content, progress tracking, and more!": "YAYC je vaš sodobni YouTube klijent, ki vam pomaga pri organizaciji načrtovane in ogledane vsebine, sledenju napredku in še več!",
